{"4563000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Root Genesis", "steam_appid": 4563000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The elites think their network is untouchable. Prove them wrong.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROOT.GENESIS</strong> is a cyberpunk idle game where you hack a shadowy elite's control network and expose the conspiracies they hide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR EMPIRE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type commands and deploy hacking tools to pwn nodes. Every key you press chips away at the elite's firewall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/087d2c10eb79d1edd11b36225fb3b4c3.poster.avif?t=1780304114\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/087d2c10eb79d1edd11b36225fb3b4c3.webm?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/087d2c10eb79d1edd11b36225fb3b4c3.mp4?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETE CONTRACTS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tools to complete contracts on the dark web and earn nodes in exchange. Each tool offers a unique contract minigame or upgrade to your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/e8c0b4fd3c314d97372d3df25482a170.poster.avif?t=1780304114\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/e8c0b4fd3c314d97372d3df25482a170.webm?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/e8c0b4fd3c314d97372d3df25482a170.mp4?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE CONSPIRACY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets hidden by the elite bloodline families. Infect their control grid and expose what lies beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/96a81072a3af3fd13c8b01d438194f0b.poster.avif?t=1780304114\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/96a81072a3af3fd13c8b01d438194f0b.webm?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/96a81072a3af3fd13c8b01d438194f0b.mp4?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The elites think their network is untouchable. Prove them wrong.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROOT.GENESIS</strong> is a cyberpunk idle game where you hack a shadowy elite's control network and expose the conspiracies they hide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR EMPIRE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type commands and deploy hacking tools to pwn nodes. Every key you press chips away at the elite's firewall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/087d2c10eb79d1edd11b36225fb3b4c3.poster.avif?t=1780304114\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/087d2c10eb79d1edd11b36225fb3b4c3.webm?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/087d2c10eb79d1edd11b36225fb3b4c3.mp4?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETE CONTRACTS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tools to complete contracts on the dark web and earn nodes in exchange. Each tool offers a unique contract minigame or upgrade to your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/e8c0b4fd3c314d97372d3df25482a170.poster.avif?t=1780304114\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/e8c0b4fd3c314d97372d3df25482a170.webm?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/e8c0b4fd3c314d97372d3df25482a170.mp4?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE CONSPIRACY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets hidden by the elite bloodline families. Infect their control grid and expose what lies beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/96a81072a3af3fd13c8b01d438194f0b.poster.avif?t=1780304114\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563000/extras/96a81072a3af3fd13c8b01d438194f0b.webm?t=1780304114\" type=\"video/web